<div class="home-divider"><span>THINK. CODE. REPEAT.</span><span>把想不明白的，慢慢想明白。 <span class="spark">✳</span></span></div>
<div class="content-grid" id="latest"><section class="posts-section"><div class="section-heading"><h2><span class="section-icon">≡</span> 最新笔记 <span class="count-badge"><%= site.posts.length.toString().padStart(2, '0') %></span></h2><a href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">全部文章 <span>→</span></a></div><div class="category-filters" aria-label="筛选当前页文章"><button class="filter active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">全部</button><% site.categories.each(function(category) { %><button class="filter" data-filter="<%= category.name %>" aria-pressed="false"><%= category.name %></button><% }) %></div><div class="post-list"><% page.posts.each(function(post) { %><%- partial('_partial/card', { post }) %><% }) %></div><p class="filter-empty" hidden>当前页还没有这个分类的文章。<a href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">查看全部归档 →</a></p><% if (page.total > 1) { %><nav class="pagination" aria-label="文章分页"><%- paginator({ prev_text: '← 上一页', next_text: '下一页 →' }) %></nav><p class="pagination-note">分类筛选仅作用于当前页；全站文章可通过搜索查找。</p><% } else { %><div class="list-end"><span></span> 笔记还在继续，故事也是 <span></span></div><% } %></section><%- partial('_partial/sidebar') %></div>
